        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly separates the current gynecologic postoperative episode from prior anorectal surgery history and confirms that the family will not confuse the two.",
        "quote": "您妈现在状态——继续观察，方向对"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
