        "explanation": "Doctor lists specific red flags including fever, bleeding, thromboembolism symptoms, and bowel obstruction signs, and instructs immediate emergency contact.",
        "quote": "高热：体温≥38.5℃，退了又反复，或伴寒战；"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
