        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00049",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains that bowel preparation and stool routine are not the same as colonoscopy or pathology, and redirects tracking toward real pending results.",
          "quote": "如果这一张只是\"病理申请单/待回报\"，那就是术后常规还没出，不一定是坏事，但要登记追结果，不要漏。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
