          "quote": "仅凭这张粪便常规，不需要专门去肛肠科。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor identified the family's confusion linking fecal routine and bowel preparation to colonoscopy/pathology, explained the difference in plain language, and redirected the family to real pending items (gynecologic pathology). The caregiver confirmed this corrected understanding.",
