        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did discover record-grounded context (uterine leiomyoma, prior anorectal surgery history, stool routine order, bowel prep) through workspace queries, but the integration into a fully reconstructed episode timeline and plan refinement was only partially demonstrated; the family's own document reading provided more detail than the doctor's explicit timeline reconstruction.",
