          "explanation": "Doctor assigns a responsible caregiver role and provides a fallback path for accessing reports and contacting the discharging service.",
          "quote": "如果有些项目查不到记录，我会告诉您是再跑一趟医院问还是可以在家观察，不会让您稀里糊涂地回家。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00101",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete checklist with owner, sequence, timing, and backup contacts for pathology and appointment booking.",
          "quote": "怎么判断自己有没有挂上：打开医院App或公众号，看\"我的挂号/预约记录\"里有没有那一天那一时段；如果那里没看到，就要按上面的方式自己挂。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor assigned the caregiver as the owner of document checking, created a short checklist with medication reconciliation, pathology follow-up, and appointment booking, provided fallback routes (call ward/pharmacy, use app, contact outpatient registration), and addressed patient reluctance by explaining why result confirmation is necessary despite feeling well.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
